"""ProblemHunt v3 features.

* Login / sign-up with a one-time code sent to MOBILE or EMAIL
* Admin approval of new accounts (optional) + delete
* Membership: redeem / voucher codes generated by admin, manual UPI/bank
  orders with an order code that admin approves or rejects
* Awareness programs (workshops, school/college/government drives) + registration
* Emergency contacts + SOS (location, family push, SMS/email to contacts)
* Fraud guide: how each fraud works, red flags, how to stop it, live trends
"""
